{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/title_en_jp.gif?t=1752807977\" /></div>Synopsis</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leona the gunslinger is, for various reasons, living life as a desperado.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/HIROIN_EN.png?t=1752807977\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, she meets Lurie, a sketchy demi-human, who persuades her to join the combat tournament held at the Colosseum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s said that if she can avoid elimination and win the tournament, all her charges will be pardoned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can Leona conquer the arena and rise as the champion?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/\u80b2\u6210.png?t=1752807977\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Perform various jobs to enhance your abilities and earn money.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/06_jp.png?t=1752807977\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Take a break once in a while to restore heatlh and remove negative status effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Spend money on gear, items and specialized training. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Fight enemies in 1v1 deathmatches.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/\u6230\u9b25.png?t=1752807977\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Prepare your deck before battle, and select the best moves to counter your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Each skill has a fixed cost and will not activate if Leona's stats are insufficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Accurately predicting the opponent's next move depends on Leona's ability to read ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Quick move selection and successive turns without taking damage will increase Leona's excitement gauge. A high excitement level triggers her Trigger-Happy mode, which increases attack power.<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/04_jp.png?t=1752807977\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Leona the Silver-Tongued</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leona uses her silver tongue to negotiate with various characters she meets.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/\u53e3\u516b\u4e01.png?t=1752807977\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Depending on the situation, her words might open up opportunities\u2014or lead to surprising outcomes.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/extras/03_jp.png?t=1752807977\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 33 H-CGs (including Live2D scenes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Seven portrait poses x Seven different outfits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">*All content within the game is uncensored.*</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3439830?t=1752807977","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3439830?t=1752807977","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/61e5fe62100b30b85e8af3606febfef5c90b7059/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752807977","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3439830/61e5fe621